## Tech Stack

| Aspect | Choice |
|---|---|
| Package manager | pnpm |
| Language | TypeScript (strict) |
| Lint + format | Biome v2 |
| Tests | Vitest (type-level, `--typecheck`) |
| Build | dts-bundle-generator → single flat `dist/index.d.ts` |
| Publish | release-please (release.yml) → npm |
| Archetype | types-package |

## Commands

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm build        # dts-bundle-generator → dist/index.d.ts
pnpm test         # vitest --typecheck (type-level only)
pnpm lint         # biome check
pnpm typecheck    # tsc --noEmit
```

## Branching

- `staging` — working branch
- `main` — production (release-please publishes from here on version tags)

## Structure

```
<%workload%>/
├── src/
│   └── index.ts        # type exports — no runtime code
├── tests/
│   └── types.test-d.ts # vitest type tests (--typecheck)
